<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" class="light">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cupons de Desconto</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = { darkMode: 'class' };
        if (localStorage.getItem('theme') === 'dark') document.documentElement.classList.add('dark');
    </script>
    <style>
        @keyframes slideUp {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        .animate-slide-up { animation: slideUp 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
        .dark .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #475569; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 transition-colors duration-300">

    <%- include('../partials/sidebar') %>

    <main class="p-4 md:p-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full animate-slide-up">
        
        <div class="mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/50 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-blue-600">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i>
                </div>
                Cupons de Desconto
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-1 ml-14">Crie códigos promocionais para atrair e fidelizar clientes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 mb-8">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-6 border-b border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 pb-3 text-gray-800 dark:text-white flex items-center">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-plus-circle text-blue-500 mr-2"></i> Adicionar Novo Cupom
            </h4>
            
            <form action="/barbearia-app/admin/cupons/salvar" method="POST" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-5 items-end">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider mb-2">Código</label>
                    <input type="text" name="codigo" placeholder="EX: PROMO10" required class="w-full p-3 uppercase font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-all placeholder:text-gray-300 dark:placeholder:text-gray-600">
                </div>
                
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider mb-2">Tipo de Desconto</label>
                    <select name="tipo" required class="w-full p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-all text-sm font-medium">
                        <option value="percentual">Percentual (%)</option>
                        <option value="fixo">Valor Fixo (R$)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider mb-2">Valor</label>
                    <input type="number" step="0.01" name="valor" placeholder="10.00" required class="w-full p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-all">
                </div>
                
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <label class="block text-xs uppercase font-bold text-gray-500 tracking-wider mb-2">Validade <span class="text-[10px] normal-case font-normal">(Opcional)</span></label>
                    <input type="date" name="data_validade" class="w-full p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 transition-all text-sm">
                </div>
                
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl shadow-md transition-transform hover:scale-105 flex items-center justify-center">
                        Criar Cupom
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto custom-scrollbar pb-2">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse min-w-[700px]">
                    <thead class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-700/50 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 uppercase text-[10px] font-black tracking-wider">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="py-4 px-6">Código do Cupom</th>
                            <th class="py-4 px-4">Desconto</th>
                            <th class="py-4 px-4">Validade</th>
                            <th class="py-4 px-4 text-center">Status</th>
                            <th class="py-4 px-6 text-center">Ações</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-50 dark:divide-gray-700/50 text-sm">
                        <% if (cupons.length === 0) { %>
                            <tr>
                                <td colspan="5" class="py-10 text-center text-gray-400 font-medium">Você ainda não criou nenhum cupom promocional.</td>
                            </tr>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <% cupons.forEach(cupom => { 
                                let validadeFormatada = "Sem limite de tempo";
                                if(cupom.data_validade) {
                                    validadeFormatada = new Date(cupom.data_validade).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR', { timeZone: 'UTC' });
                                }
                            %>
                                <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50/50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/30 transition-colors">
                                    <td class="py-4 px-6">
                                        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 font-black tracking-widest uppercase border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800 shadow-sm">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-tag text-xs mr-2 opacity-70"></i><%= cupom.codigo %>
                                        </span>
                                    </td>
                                    
                                    <td class="py-4 px-4 font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 text-lg">
                                        <%= cupom.tipo === 'percentual' ? cupom.valor + '%' : 'R$ ' + Number(cupom.valor).toFixed(2) %>
                                    </td>
                                    
                                    <td class="py-4 px-4 text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-medium">
                                        <% if (cupom.data_validade) { %>
                                            <i class="fa-regular fa-calendar-xmark mr-1"></i> <%= validadeFormatada %>
                                        <% } else { %>
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-infinity mr-1 text-gray-300"></i> <%= validadeFormatada %>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </td>
                                    
                                    <td class="py-4 px-4 text-center">
                                        <a href="/barbearia-app/admin/cupons/status/<%= cupom.id %>" class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-sm <%= cupom.ativo ? 'bg-green-100 text-green-700 border border-green-200 hover:bg-green-200 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:border-green-800' : 'bg-red-100 text-red-700 border border-red-200 hover:bg-red-200 dark:bg-red-900/30 dark:border-red-800' %>" title="Clique para ativar/desativar">
                                            <% if(cupom.ativo){ %>
                                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 mr-1.5"></span> Ativo
                                            <% } else { %>
                                                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 mr-1.5"></span> Inativo
                                            <% } %>
                                        </a>
                                    </td>
                                    
                                    <td class="py-4 px-6 text-center">
                                        <button type="button" onclick="abrirModalExcluirCupom('<%= cupom.id %>', '<%= cupom.codigo %>')" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-white transition-colors" title="Excluir Cupom">
                                            <i class="fa-solid fa-trash text-xs"></i>
                                        </button>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            <% }) %>
                        <% } %>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <div id="modalExcluirCupom" class="fixed inset-0 bg-gray-900/80 backdrop-blur-sm z-[9999] hidden flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300">
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl max-w-sm w-full mx-4 p-6 shadow-2xl text-center transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300" id="modalExcluirCupomContent">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-4xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-2 text-gray-800 dark:text-white">Atenção!</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4 text-sm">
                Deseja realmente excluir o cupom <strong id="codigoCupomExcluir" class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-base"></strong>?
            </p>

            <div class="bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/30 p-4 rounded-xl mb-6 border border-red-100 dark:border-red-800 text-xs text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 text-left flex gap-3">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info mt-0.5 text-lg"></i>
                <p>
                    <strong>Excluir este cupom resultará num relatório financeiro com erros.</strong> Se ele já foi utilizado, o desconto continuará aplicado aos agendamentos, mas o sistema perderá o registo de onde o dinheiro "sumiu".<br><br>
                    <span class="block mt-2 font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">Dica: É mais seguro cancelar na tabela, alterando o status para <strong>"Inativo"</strong>.</span>
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="flex gap-3">
                <button onclick="toggleModal('modalExcluirCupom')" class="w-full py-3 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-gray-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition">Cancelar</button>
                <a id="btnConfirmarExclusaoCupom" href="#" class="w-full py-3 bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold shadow transition flex items-center justify-center">
                    Sim, Excluir
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="/barbearia-app/public/js/cupon_admin.js"></script>
    <script src="/barbearia-app/public/js/theme.js"></script>
</body>
</html>